Generic single-database configuration for Alembic migrations.

## Create a migration

```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Add user table"
```

## Run migrations

```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

## Rollback migrations

```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```

## Show current migration version

```bash
alembic current
```

## Show migration history

```bash
alembic history
```
